WEBVTT

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:18.860
It couldn't be.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:20.610
Step up and take a look!

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:22.530
Forget the final battle with White!

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:26.780
If you want to keep on living once it's done,
you're gonna have to eat!

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:28.280
The final battle.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:29.860
Then the king really has...

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.980
How about it, young man?

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:35.730
Wait, what are you doing around here?!

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:41.280
They not only left Lady Groza out of
the war effort, but Your Highness as well?

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:44.110
Don't tell me you rebelled?

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.940
Of course not.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:50.190
Actually, I wonder...

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:52.280
That's hardly reassuring!

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:58.820
Oh, but if Your Highness does take the throne,
please lower taxes a bit.

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:00.030
I'll keep it in mind.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:01.570
Your Highness!

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:03.070
Hello.

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.900
Oh, hello.

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:07.780
Hey, will we win the war?

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:09.690
Mom was telling me about it!

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:13.320
She said that floating island
makes it hard to dry laundry!

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:15.940
I bet she'll be happy if we win!

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:18.230
Make sure we win, okay?

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:20.900
Yes, I'm sure we will.

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:22.650
Your Highness!

00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:24.980
May I have a moment?

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:27.940
These soldiers are scary.

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:29.190
You want a piece of me?!

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:32.730
I do not. My business is with His Highness.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:35.320
Would you please accompany me?

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:36.570
What is it?

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:41.070
I was only ordered to summon Your Highness.

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:43.900
Why's he acting so menacing?

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:45.570
Who knows?

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:48.570
Sorry, I have to go now.

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:51.860
Take care.

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:53.400
Thank you.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.400
Let's go.

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:55.860
I beg your pardon.

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:58.530
All right, take His Highness away!

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:02.780
Your Highness...

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:32.460
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:37.530
<i>Under the "light and dark" called justice</i>

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:42.150
<i>our wishes run aground in twilight</i>

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:49.530
<i>If you want the tomorrow</i>
<i>on the other side of the mirror,</i>

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:51.530
<i>go through nightmares</i>

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:56.440
<i>Lives fragmented like the sea and sky</i>

00:02:56.440 --> 00:03:00.980
<i>Even if we realize that</i>
<i>their resemblance is false,</i>

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:04.730
<i>we can at least not give it words, give it form,</i>

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:07.360
<i>or doubt our bonds</i>

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:13.110
<i>and tell ourselves that</i>
<i>even blindness is a mercy</i>

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:15.650
<i>White or black? The scales of Libra</i>

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:18.480
<i>waver cruelly</i>

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:23.690
<i>Together we cling, tenaciously,</i>
<i>to our sliver of a promise</i>

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:25.730
<i>We looked up at a nebula</i>

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:28.690
<i>of numberless dystopias</i>

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:31.360
<i>I crawled through the mud, mind ablaze,</i>

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:35.940
<i>and met you on the far side</i>
<i>of the scales of Libra</i>

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:45.980
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:48.950
"Chapter 11"
"The Distant Sky"

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:50.610
Theo,

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:55.650
the next battle may span the entire kingdom.

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:56.940
If that happens...

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:57.900
I'll run!

00:03:57.900 --> 00:03:59.110
Run where?

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.360
Out to sea.

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.730
How?

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:04.940
It's far, but with magic...

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:07.230
That's a last resort.

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:09.650
Hide in a safe place.

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:14.940
And where am I supposed to find a safe place?!

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:18.650
I'm not going to bother you
with questions like that.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.400
Good boy.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:26.230
You'd better run too if it looks
like you're going to lose.

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:28.070
Your big brother won't lose.

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:32.570
Doesn't that mean you'll end up
fighting alone forever?

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:34.780
So, if that happens, run!

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:37.650
You've sure gotten smarter.

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:39.650
But it'll be fine.

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:43.070
Our kingdom won't lose!

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:46.980
After all, we've got Her Majesty Iris,
the Queen of Light, on our side!

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:50.230
Yeah, you're right.

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:54.360
As long as we have faith in Her Majesty,
our kingdom will never lose!

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:55.780
--Yes.
--Yup!

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:59.280
I believe in you, Iris!

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:06.320
I swear that as long as I have
even a spark of life in me,

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:10.400
I'll keep defending you!

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:21.400
We'll bring peace to this world together.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:23.610
I promise.

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:25.530
A promise...

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:34.150
White is light, Black is darkness...
Sky and earth.

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:38.320
Let's support each other
from where we each belong.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.480
O Progenitor Rune!

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:50.150
Bestow your power on all the people
of the Kingdom of White!

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:53.570
Give us light to drive back the darkness!

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:58.780
This is the end.

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:00.030
Let's go!

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:02.280
Yes, sir!

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:04.190
It's started!

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:08.360
Phious, Sheama, good luck!

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.860
Fire!

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:15.900
Good work, Sheama!

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:18.070
We can't afford to lose either!

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:22.110
Don't let a single one escape!

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:23.280
Push them back!

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:25.900
Yes, sir!

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:38.280
The King of Darkness!

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:50.610
Good! At this rate--

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:08.400
Lady Sheama, we can't shoot them all down!

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:18.190
First company, follow me
to the second castle gate!

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:21.530
Everyone else, stop as many
of them here as you can!

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:28.530
Fall back to before the castle gates!

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:30.980
We must defend this place to the last!

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:36.030
Things below have grown quite lively.

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:41.110
Can you afford to flit through
the sky at your ease?

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:43.900
Well, Queen of Light?

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:46.940
It's your location that matters.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.440
Yours and mine.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:52.480
That is where destiny will be decided!

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:54.570
Very well.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:59.400
Apart from our contest,
all this strife is mere pretense.

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:01.650
Each extreme of the balance

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:04.150
is occupied by a single person:

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:07.610
me and you.

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:08.940
Yes.

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:14.440
Let's settle this!

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:18.940
Hurry to the palace!

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:21.110
The fighting will reach here soon!

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.230
Are you all right?

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:30.860
Y-Yeah.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:32.610
Thank you very much.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:33.440
Now go.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:34.320
Right!

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:35.980
Damn the forces of darkness.

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:39.690
They're running rampant over our holy continent.

00:08:39.690 --> 00:08:42.940
Yes, we have to keep at least the palace--

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:45.070
Wh-What's wrong?!

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:47.070
Wh-What the--

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:00.780
Are you all right?!

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:02.860
Wh-What was that?

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:05.280
We'll protect you.

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:07.400
Now, hurry to the palace!

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.190
R-Right!

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:17.900
Whoa!

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:19.320
That was close.

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:21.360
What was that?!

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:24.440
It would have hit anyone but me!

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:27.730
Damn it, everyone's fighting.

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:30.480
It's sink or swim now.

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:31.860
Even I can help!

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:45.110
I managed that somehow.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:52.230
Is killing them the only way?!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:55.900
Mage forces, linked incantation!

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.320
Yes, ma'am!

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:58.900
Become manifest!

00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:03.150
One of the seven powers: Scythe of Destruction!

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:07.730
Mow them down!

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.360
Continue support!

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:18.320
Erect a ward around the knights!

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.400
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:20.900
Become manifest!

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:25.030
One of the seven powers: Cage of Affection.

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:27.820
Block the darkness!

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:46.780
There's no end to them.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:57.110
All right, men, don't retreat another step!

00:10:57.110 --> 00:11:00.320
We are Her Majesty's last line of defense!

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:01.530
Yes, sir!

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:07.070
I see you don't lack for enthusiasm.

00:11:07.070 --> 00:11:08.480
And you are?

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.400
The dark knight Vallus.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:12.980
I see you are a worthy opponent.

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:15.230
May I request a bout?

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:16.320
Oh?

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:19.570
You have some nerve to ask that
without recognizing me.

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:22.650
I am Phious, commander of the Knights of Light.

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:25.860
I am the queen's shield and also her sword!

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:29.030
I'll never let you pass!

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:35.440
In that case, I suggest you burn your name
into my memory through combat!

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:36.860
Don't make me laugh!

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:39.360
Rise up,

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:41.730
darkly blazing ones!

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:53.480
I don't recall how many times we've fought.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.030
Do you believe you can best me?

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:58.570
You're saying you always won before?

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.570
You always retreated.

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:03.230
Don't be so frightened.

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:08.650
I am not like light, which thins
as it spreads until it ultimately vanishes.

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:11.070
I am darkness.

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:13.860
That means endless expansion.

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:18.690
It is clear which of us will
grow in power over time.

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.230
Is that so?

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:21.780
That is why

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:24.900
we are constrained to the system of succession.

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:27.400
I won't let you feign ignorance of that.

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:32.940
I will defy the cycle and become
the one and only King of Darkness.

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.110
My power will grow forever!

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:37.940
It will cover all places, all space!

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.480
Darker than darkness!

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:41.730
It will blot out everything!

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:43.650
"Forever"?

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:47.110
I won't allow it!

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:52.480
Rebel against natural law,
begone from this world!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:13:01.000
"No. 11 The People of White"
"White's people live lives of plenty
thanks to abundant Soul
and the Progenitor Rune's blessing.
The haves can never imagine
the plight of the have-nots..."

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:12.150
The Cage of Affection is...!

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:15.280
We can't hold back the encroaching darkness!

00:13:27.230 --> 00:13:29.150
Wh-What should we do?

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:30.480
In that case...

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:31.650
Become manifest!

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:35.070
One of the seven powers: Flow!

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:36.610
Turn it back!

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:42.780
You did it, Lady Sheama!

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:47.820
It can't be!

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:51.190
Why?!

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:52.360
How?!

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:54.070
I can't dispel it!

00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:58.280
Progenitor Rune!

00:13:58.280 --> 00:14:00.320
Now, this moment!

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:04.110
If you won't give us your power now,
what will you do?!

00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:17.110
Your strikes are laughably straightforward.

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:20.610
Then why don't you parry them?!

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:27.730
What supports you?

00:14:29.980 --> 00:14:32.650
Loyalty to Her Majesty, of course!

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:34.820
Then, like her...

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:39.980
...you will lose.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.650
What?

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:45.150
Concern for an individual is like a heat haze:

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:47.820
once shaken, it is easily dispelled.

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.730
That's a difference of opinion.

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:54.320
Blind devotion to a title
invites your master's ruin.

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:57.860
It's because I believe in her as a person,

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:01.650
that my feelings... give me strength!

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:04.900
Don't spout

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:06.650
such wasteful indulgence!

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:12.400
What did you say?!

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:17.980
I said that <i>that</i> is what makes
your kingdom's people weak!

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:24.980
Fertile land, a harmonious people,
a wise sovereign, favored blades!

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:30.530
You think you can just conveniently
protect everything with those?!

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:34.480
Phious, knight of light!

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:37.860
I will always remember your name!

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:41.070
As a foolish weakling!

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:44.690
You boast of your misfortune?!

00:15:56.940 --> 00:16:02.900
Words, become the key to the power of light
and unleash the Rune's radiance!

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:08.190
Calida lux, puram lucem!

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:11.280
You still endure?

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.690
Enough bluffing!

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:15.860
I'll erase you here and now!

00:16:15.860 --> 00:16:21.610
Are you sure you should be monopolizing
the Progenitor Rune's power?

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:24.190
Don't underestimate my scraps.

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:28.230
They will infect your beloved people
with darkness first!

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:30.030
I won't fall for that!

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:33.980
If the balance remains disturbed,
that will happen eventually anyway!

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:38.320
I won't let you escape,
even if it takes all I have!

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:40.110
I concur.

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:43.360
The people are part of "everything."

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:44.980
I'm not like you!

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:46.110
We are the same.

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:47.030
You're wrong!

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:48.530
You will be hated.

00:16:48.530 --> 00:16:50.230
Even if I am,

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:51.570
I don't care!

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:55.400
Restoring the balance

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:59.320
is the only way to preserve the future!

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:02.610
How naive.

00:17:02.610 --> 00:17:06.940
Between you, who seek balance,
and me, who triumphs in overturning it,

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:09.230
the outcome is obvious!

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:10.650
No!

00:17:11.570 --> 00:17:13.360
Even so!

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:20.110
Bahl claimed that I "boasted" as well.

00:17:20.110 --> 00:17:23.190
Those who speak of the impossible lose!

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:24.440
It's time you learned!

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:27.070
This is the way of the world!

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:42.690
L-Lady Sheama.

00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:44.280
Become manifest.

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:48.320
One of the seven powers: Light of Affection.

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:51.030
Save the wounded soldiers!

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:02.780
Progenitor... Rune.

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:06.940
Why?

00:18:09.570 --> 00:18:12.190
Aren't you supposed to be infinite?!

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:13.900
What are you good for?!

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.900
Shine, damn it!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.480
It's hopeless.

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:25.610
No, not yet.

00:18:25.610 --> 00:18:28.690
It's too soon to complain.

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.820
If incantations won't work,

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:32.530
we'll just pummel them!

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:40.400
Sheama.

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:42.530
Iris!

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:45.480
I could hear your shout of defiance.

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:47.110
I'd expect no less.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:51.980
More importantly,
what about the Progenitor Rune?

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:54.860
Have you forgotten?

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:57.530
There's still a way.

00:18:57.530 --> 00:19:01.610
One of the seven powers: the Gears of Fate!

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:04.650
If we pour everything into that, then...!

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:07.030
Mages, assemble!

00:19:07.030 --> 00:19:08.900
Yes, ma'am.

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:10.570
This is everyone.

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:13.230
Keep it together!

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:15.230
This is no time to space out!

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:18.530
You're right.

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:22.900
Gears of Fate, one of the seven powers,

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:25.940
I object to your turning!

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:31.030
Show me the path to the truth I ought to reach!

00:20:09.690 --> 00:20:11.030
What?!

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:13.480
Nothing... changed.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.820
Is this destruction unavoidable?

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:20.570
Our promise...

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:23.940
Hey, Iris...?

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:25.940
Iris, come on.

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:30.650
Fate, is it?

00:20:30.650 --> 00:20:32.190
A wasted effort.

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:37.190
The history I have plotted
runs too deep for that.

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:39.360
Th-That can't be.

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:43.480
If it's come to this...

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:45.440
There's still a way, right?

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:48.360
A way for you to fight back
as the Queen of Light?!

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:49.650
But...

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:50.940
Go!

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:55.070
Is this any time for doubts?!

00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:56.980
What is your duty as queen?!

00:20:56.980 --> 00:21:00.110
I'll give everything! Even my life!

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.940
All to you!

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.780
So, hurry!

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:12.110
Sheama... Thank you.

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:13.570
How unsightly.

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:15.280
How long will you struggle?

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:17.150
Accept your fated--

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:19.650
Do you ever shut up?!

00:21:19.650 --> 00:21:21.610
Interesting!

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:35.400
Lady Sheama?!

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:40.980
It appears I've let one of my bad habits show:

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:43.030
"playfulness."

00:21:57.230 --> 00:22:00.820
Progenitor... Rune.

00:22:16.570 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>I walk the quiet streets alone</i>

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:24.940
<i>in my memories</i>

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:28.400
<i>The times I can't see you</i>

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:34.730
<i>lead me a little astray, a fleeting light</i>

00:22:34.730 --> 00:22:44.190
<i>I want to touch your darkness,</i>

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:54.360
<i>what lies beyond it and its truth</i>

00:22:54.360 --> 00:22:57.900
<i>Let me light your darkness</i>

00:22:57.900 --> 00:23:00.730
<i>Even if we're apart</i>

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:07.440
<i>Won't you let me light your darkness?</i>

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:10.280
<i>I'll find you</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:18.650
<i>Run, light,</i>

00:23:18.650 --> 00:23:21.980
<i>to where you are</i>

00:23:21.980 --> 00:23:24.820
<i>Through the dark</i>

00:23:26.730 --> 00:23:30.150
<i>Through the dark</i>

00:23:44.030 --> 00:23:46.980
"Next Time"
